wait-for Search the web
shot start-page
tap-id address
expect Search or enter address
shot start-keyboard
tap-id kb.cancel
tap-id samples
expect Sample pages
tap-id navigate
tap-id page-view
wait-for-id native-reader
shot page-address-bar
tap-id edit-address
expect samples.browse.invalid
shot page-address-edit

tap-id kb.r0c0
expect samples.browse.invalid/q
tap-id kb.cancel
wait-for-id native-reader
shot page-keyboard-dismissed
